Package: rinstagram
Title: Instagram Analytics and Intelligence Platform
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Moritz", "Dresch", , "Mo.Dresch@campus.lmu.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = ""))
Description: An end-to-end Instagram analytics platform for R. Scrape real-time
    profile data, track growth over time with SQLite persistence, and run
    machine learning inference (engagement prediction, bot detection, growth
    forecasting, niche classification) via a FastAPI microservice. Includes an
    interactive Shiny dashboard for visualization.
